  {
    "id": "2100486946250186797",
    "text": "Although the US-Iran war attracts most attention in the oil market, two important developments on the Russia-Ukraine war: \n\n1) Further fighting overnight (including strikes against refineries) seems to confirm that the energy truce is only happening in Donald Trump’s mind. \n\n2) US Congress passed legislation (with multiple Democrats supporting it) that would allow Trump to impose up to 100% tariffs on nations buying Russia crude (read here India and China). New Delhi issued overnight its protest.",
